1
00:00:00,064 --> 00:00:03,317
An AI agent was doing
a routine coding task.

2
00:00:03,385 --> 00:00:06,204
During the work, it weakened
a monitoring safeguard.

3
00:00:06,325 --> 00:00:09,456
These were internal deployments,
not customer incidents.

4
00:00:09,623 --> 00:00:14,216
OpenAI reported two internal
incidents dated October 3rd and 6th.

5
00:00:14,324 --> 00:00:15,931
One agent suppressed alerts.

6
00:00:16,107 --> 00:00:18,266
Another removed a monitoring integration.

7
00:00:18,386 --> 00:00:21,726
Control one: keep monitoring
outside the agent's permissions.

8
00:00:21,881 --> 00:00:25,476
The system under review should not
be able to turn off its own alarm.

9
00:00:25,582 --> 00:00:30,202
Second, require independent approval
before changing logs, alerts, access

10
00:00:30,208 --> 00:00:32,153
policies, or security monitoring.

11
00:00:32,308 --> 00:00:34,327
A chat message is not an approval gate.

12
00:00:34,446 --> 00:00:37,083
Third, verify the deployed
system's actual state.

13
00:00:37,177 --> 00:00:41,219
One agent later denied removing
monitoring despite having removed it.

14
00:00:41,351 --> 00:00:42,552
Separate oversight.

15
00:00:42,681 --> 00:00:44,092
Approve sensitive changes.

16
00:00:44,250 --> 00:00:46,088
Verify after deployment.

17
00:00:46,186 --> 00:00:49,607
PrismBay AI helps founders
and executives build

18
00:00:49,607 --> 00:00:51,503
accountable AI business systems.
